WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:00.973
- What was that?

00:00:00.973 --> 00:00:03.140
(scary music)

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:07.960
(logo whooshing)
(logo squeaking)

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:10.560
You can buy a lot of
haunted things from eBay.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:14.050
A lot of them are dolls,
most of them are dolls.

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:16.000
Another kind of haunted item you can get

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.500
from eBay is haunted jewelry.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.100
I decided to buy a piece of
haunted jewelry off of eBay,

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:25.840
wear it, and see if I
experience anything paranormal.

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.400
I found a haunted bracelet.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.610
The woman selling the
haunted bracelet said

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:34.610
she was a collector of haunted
items and haunted jewelry.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:37.500
Nine years ago, she went to Italy

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.030
and she went to a flea market.

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:42.550
She went to a stand that
was selling antique jewelry.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:45.560
And she said she felt energies coming

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:48.390
from some of the items
at the jewelry stand.

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:50.210
So she picked up this bracelet.

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:52.770
But when she picked it up, the Italian man

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:55.890
who was selling the jewelry
didn't want her to buy it.

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:58.170
He didn't really speak much
English, but apparently,

00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:00.360
he said, "No good, cursed."

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.280
I guess my question is, if he doesn't want

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:04.210
anyone to buy this cursed bracelet,

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:06.560
why does he have it out
at his jewelry stand?

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:08.760
Why not keep it at home or get rid of it?

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:10.930
Maybe the curse is that
he can't get rid of it,

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:11.763
I don't know.

00:01:11.763 --> 00:01:13.140
The woman tried to explain to the man

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:15.550
that she's a collector of paranormal items

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:17.470
and that she could
handle it, so she bought

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:18.900
the bracelet and took it home.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.210
When she took the bracelet home,

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:23.200
it started showing up in
weird places around the house

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.940
where she definitely hadn't left it.

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:26.190
She said the temperature would drop

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:28.610
when she was wearing it
or when she was around it.

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:31.800
She felt like whatever
spirit possessed the bracelet

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.810
was trying to feed off her energy.

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:35.290
She said she wanted to get rid of it

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:37.970
'cause she felt like it
was possessed by an entity

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.180
that she didn't wanna deal with anymore.

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:41.730
The bracelet came in the mail.

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:43.230
I have it in this envelope.

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:45.373
Let's bust out this cursed bracelet.

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:51.800
Okay, it is smaller than
I thought it would be.

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:53.390
Don't be mad at me, ghost, I just thought

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:55.300
this was a bigger bracelet, okay.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:56.880
So the woman who sold this bracelet

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.860
said she has no idea how old it is

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:01.270
because there's no markings on it.

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:03.240
I'm gonna wear it and we're gonna see

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:05.050
if anything weird happens.

00:02:05.050 --> 00:02:07.780
So I actually do wish that
there was like a ghost

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:09.910
inside this bracelet to help me put it on,

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:11.480
because it's one of those bracelets

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:14.220
that's really hard to get
on without somebody's help.

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:17.270
I have placed the bracelet onto my wrist.

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:19.990
It's pretty hot in here, but this bracelet

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:23.750
feels oddly cold against my skin.

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:24.920
It feels very cold.

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:27.080
But it could just be because
it's super hot in here

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:30.790
that anything metal is going
to feel very refreshing.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.530
I do like the tiny
people on this bracelet.

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:34.570
They're very cute.

00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:37.070
- This looks like George Washington.

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:39.258
Oh no, am I going to be
cursed now that I touched it?

00:02:39.258 --> 00:02:40.550
- [Joanna] I don't know.

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:42.110
- See, I just got a chill.

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:43.000
- [Joanna] You did?

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.119
- I legitimately just got like a chill.

00:02:46.119 --> 00:02:49.650
- I've been wearing
this bracelet for maybe

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:54.543
30 minutes and I just feel so tired.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:59.033
Something is stealing my energy.

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:02.440
I don't know if it's a ghost,
but I'm definitely tired.

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:05.570
Something super weird did happen to me

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:08.080
and I have no explanation for it.

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:11.630
Somehow, I got lipstick

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:13.640
all over my computer.

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:17.130
And I swear to God, I
did not kiss my computer.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.800
It's not on my hands.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.640
There's not lipstick on anything else.

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:23.139
I have no idea how I got
lipstick on my computer.

00:03:23.139 --> 00:03:24.940
It's super weird.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:27.690
I just got home, it's about eight o'clock.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:30.120
I'm still wearing the bracelet.

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:32.730
Normally, I have a rule that I don't bring

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:36.580
haunted things into my
home, but I broke the rule

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:39.250
by wearing this bracelet,
so that's not great.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:43.350
I'm definitely way more
tired than I normally am.

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:46.370
If there's a ghost sucking
my energy with this bracelet,

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.090
it's doing an amazing job.

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:51.150
I feel kind of relieved
to take off the bracelet.

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:54.010
It is nice to just stop

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:56.470
wearing an evil bracelet for the day.

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:59.110
So I'm definitely on
edge, being home alone

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.860
with the haunted bracelet.

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:03.970
Every time I hear any noise,
I'm just like, what was that?

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.280
I am hearing some very unusual noises

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:07.710
that I've never heard before.

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:11.340
Is there a weird vibration
going through the attic?

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:12.840
Which is not ideal.

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:14.990
I'm trying to just be chill about it,

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:16.750
but there's a cursed bracelet

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.660
just hanging out where I sleep.

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:20.760
Whenever I'm scared, I like to just

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.310
look out the window across the street

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:25.097
at my neighbors and I
can always see their TV

00:04:25.097 --> 00:04:27.000
through the window and I'm just like,

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.070
okay, the neighbors are
watching TV, everything's chill.

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:32.610
I keep wanting to throw
the bracelet outside

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:34.840
every time I hear a weird noise.

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.550
This is why I don't bring
haunted things into the house.

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:38.950
Don't buy haunted bracelet.

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:41.560
I'm just recording where I'm leaving it

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:45.310
in case it's in a different
place in the morning.

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:47.040
I hope that it stays right here.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.640
I thought maybe when
I woke up this morning

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:51.890
and came out to the living
room, I would see a ghost child.

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:56.290
And I did not see that, so
my bracelet, thankfully,

00:04:56.290 --> 00:05:00.080
is exactly where I left it,
right on top of my wallet.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:03.337
One of my cabinets is weirdly open

00:05:03.337 --> 00:05:05.480
and I definitely didn't leave it open.

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:07.770
So either my husband or a ghost did this.

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:09.510
So I've had kind of a rough morning.

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:11.040
I'm wearing the bracelet.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.220
I woke up 6:00 a.m. to
try to go to the DMV

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:16.000
to renew my driver's license.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.900
My train was late and

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:21.070
it took way longer than it's supposed to.

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:24.140
Even though I got up two hours early,

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:27.810
to go to the DMV, I was
still two hours late to work.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:31.150
So I don't know, is it
the curse of the bracelet?

00:05:31.150 --> 00:05:33.068
I've been wearing this bracelet all day.

00:05:33.068 --> 00:05:36.393
A few bad, weird things did happen.

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:42.530
Maybe this bracelet is cursed.

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:45.280
If you're scared of ghosts and
you wanna get over that fear,

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:48.780
buy something haunted from
eBay, like a bracelet,

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:52.490
hang out with it, and then
if nothing scary happens,

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:54.880
maybe you'll feel a
little bit less scared.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:57.910
And then if something scary does happen,

00:05:57.910 --> 00:06:00.680
you'll know that your fear was justified

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:03.870
and you'll feel smart for being afraid.

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:07.483
For the record, I'm never
bringing this into my house again.

00:06:07.483 --> 00:06:10.066
(gentle music)

00:06:18.581 --> 00:06:20.868
(logo whooshing)
(logo squeaking)

